            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life and Education</strong><br>\nMichael Collins was born on October 31, 1930, in Rome, Italy, where his father was stationed as a major general in the U.S. Army. He pursued his education at the United States Military Academy at West Point, choosing to join the Air Force after graduation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Air Force Career</strong><br>\nCollins flew F-86 fighter jets with the Air Force, serving as a test pilot and attending the Air Force Experimental Flight Test Pilot School, which laid the groundwork for his selection into NASA's astronaut program.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Joining NASA</strong><br>\nChosen by NASA in 1963, Collins' first spaceflight was aboard Gemini 10, during which he performed two spacewalks and helped develop techniques for future Apollo missions.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Apollo 11 Mission</strong><br>\nAs the command module pilot for Apollo 11, Collins remained in lunar orbit while his crewmates, Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin, made the first crewed landing on the moon's surface in 1969.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Post-Apollo Career</strong><br>\nAfter his famous Apollo mission, Collins took on a role as Assistant Secretary of State for Public Affairs and later became the director of the National Air and Space Museum in Washington, D.C.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Author and Advocate</strong><br>\nCollins wrote several books about his experiences, including the autobiographies \"Carrying the Fire\" and \"Flying to the Moon and Other Strange Places,\" promoting public understanding of space.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
